<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Fleet xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Name>A1 Kitty Petter Caps PTB</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>Stock/Protectorate</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=green&gt;EASY&lt;/color&gt;
  Kitty Petters but OSP. R3s are used as penaids for S2s. When using R3s off of EO Pike track, aim to fire from 5km. When not using R3s firing off of locks or LRT track, use the full stand-off range.
  MultiRole loadouts contain ARAD val breadsticks, perfect for engaging skiffs and bombers you encounter.
  Against cappers, use groups of 4 gunpod bombers. When unable to engage before the capper gets onto the point, the S2 loadouts are necessary to deny in time.
  Against Aurora BDDs, the R3s are relied upon to pen, so don't use the gunpod loadouts against them.
  Against capitals, a flight of 8 using 3 'Full Strike' and 1 'Finisher Strike' per Jman can generate ss32 + 14 R3s, easily enough to cripple an axford, BB, or ~2 Vauxes in a 3CL group.
  Against Blobs, a flight of 8 using 3 'Anti-Blob Strike' and 1 'Anti-Blob Finisher' per Jman can again generate ss32 + 14 R3s, enough to pen blob PD.
  </Description>
  <SortOverrideOrder xsi:nil="true" />
